  "final_answer": "Based on the map, I can see the route from DoubleTree (south) to ALDI (north) goes through University Blvd. Walmart Supercenter is visible to the west of the route, and is closer to DoubleTree based on my earlier calculation (0.8 miles vs 0.9 miles for ALDI).\n\nI have all the data I need:\n\n**Summary of findings:**\n\n**Closest Hilton hotel to Pittsburgh Airport:**\nI compared the walking distances from Pittsburgh Airport to the Hilton hotels in the area:\n- DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel Pittsburgh Airport (8402 University Blvd, Moon Township): **5.8 miles / 2 hr 11 min** walking\n- Hilton Garden Inn Pittsburgh Airport (9600 University Blvd, Moon Township): 6.2 miles / 2 hr 20 min walking\n- Hilton Garden Inn Pittsburgh Airport South - Robinson Mall: farther (near Robinson Mall)\n- Homewood Suites by Hilton Pittsburgh Airport Robinson Mall Area: farther (near Robinson Mall)\n\nThe **DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel Pittsburgh Airport** is the closest Hilton hotel to Pittsburgh Airport.\n\n**Walking time from DoubleTree to nearest supermarket:**\nI checked supermarkets near the DoubleTree:\n- **Walmart Supercenter (7500 University Blvd, Moon Township): 17 minutes / 0.8 miles** (closest)\n- ALDI (2830 Gracy Center Way): 21 minutes / 0.9 miles\n- Giant Eagle Supermarket (5990 University Blvd): 25 minutes / 1.1 miles\n\n---\n\n## Final Answer\n\n**The Hilton hotel closest to Pittsburgh Airport is the DoubleTree by Hilton Hotel Pittsburgh Airport** (8402 University Blvd, Moon Township, PA 15108). It is approximately 5.8 miles from the airport (2 hours 11 minutes walking, or 10 minutes driving).\n\n**The nearest supermarket from the hotel is Walmart Supercenter** (7500 University Blvd, Moon Township, PA 15108), and the **walking time is approximately 17 minutes** (0.8 miles via University Blvd).",
